  "text": "`requirements.md` has been generated and validated at `.sdlc/runs/20261104-160801-feature-extend-scaffolder-conditional-fields/requirements.md`.\n\n### Summary of Requirements Analysis\n- **In scope & Out of scope**: Scoped strictly to `@backstage/plugin-scaffolder-react` (`Stepper`, `ReviewState`, `useTemplateSchema`, `extractSchemaFromStep`), `@backstage/plugin-scaffolder` (`TemplateWizardPage`, `TemplateEditorForm`, `TemplateFormPreviewer`), template-author documentation (`docs/features/software-templates/input-examples.md`, `writing-templates.md`), and `.changeset/*cross-step*.md`.\n- **Functional Requirements (FR-1 \u2013 FR-9)**: Defined delta requirements for cross-step conditional field resolution (`dependencies`, `if`/`then`/`else`), unset/default handling on earlier steps, conditional `required` and custom field validation per step, back-navigation stale state cleanup, `ReviewState` / `findSchemaForKey` cross-step resolution, wizard/editor preview compatibility, documentation, and changesets.\n- **Non-Functional Requirements (NFR-1 \u2013 NFR-5), PII Inventory, Role Matrix, & Acceptance Criteria (AC-1 \u2013 AC-7)**: Grounded in the branch's symbols, repo conventions, and the Gate 0 verification command (`CI=true yarn test plugins/scaffolder-react plugins/scaffolder && yarn tsc && yarn lint:all`).",
